Not for the seats.

00:04:42.620 --> 00:04:45.620
Not for the seats. Interesting. Interesting.

00:04:45.620 --> 00:04:51.620
I have a friend of mine who is... we have the most brilliant mind, illegal mind in Israel.

00:04:51.620 --> 00:04:55.620
and he told me, I have to do with the pension.

