Wow, pension, pension, how is the pension?

00:05:01.620 --> 00:05:11.620
Because Netanyahu promised them that he will give them the same amount of ministers, yes?

00:05:11.620 --> 00:05:16.620
Five ministers, no matter how many seats you are going to have,

00:05:16.620 --> 00:05:22.160
have or how little seat you're going to have, you're going to have, I'll give you the same

00:05:22.160 --> 00:05:33.140
amount of ministers in the cabinet. So the problem was that in Israel, if you are a member

00:05:33.140 --> 00:05:41.420
