00:05:41.420 --> 00:05:45.640
they will have only, I don't know, 70 or less than full pension.

00:05:46.040 --> 00:05:48.300
Because they would not be running,

00:05:48.560 --> 00:05:50.840
they would not be in Knesset for four consecutive years.

00:05:51.240 --> 00:05:52.340
So they didn't want it to.

00:05:53.100 --> 00:05:54.380
And that is the problem.

00:05:54.920 --> 00:05:57.340
So Jerusalem is being held up by somebody's pension?

00:05:57.800 --> 00:05:58.260
Correct.

00:05:59.000 --> 00:05:59.400
Correct.

