But, one second, but they don't have laws of taref. There's no taref in the law. What does it mean?

01:22:43.040 --> 01:22:50.040
That is what happened, as your father will tell you, anybody. They, Jews, they will be doing a shahita,

01:22:50.040 --> 01:22:57.040
and every animal that is taref, we sell it automatically to the market. That is exactly what happened all the time.

01:22:57.040 --> 01:23:14.420
We used to slaughter in the same slaughterhouse. Every behemoth that comes out of Taref automatically goes to Muhammad. That's the truth. These were the coming of the Jews.

01:23:14.420 --> 01:23:21.420
That's why, on the one hand, there is shahitah, on the other hand, no Jew ever would be going to eat with them. Why? Because there is no tereh.

01:23:21.420 --> 01:23:33.420
Pachut. Yes? Alright? Now, there were all kinds of things that we did to make sure that on the one hand, they need our services,

01:23:33.420 --> 01:23:40.140
And on the other hand, we are not going to get involved with them, for instance.

01:23:40.920 --> 01:23:41.060
Yes.

01:23:42.640 --> 01:23:43.720
Pig? No pig.

01:23:45.320 --> 01:23:45.680
Yes.

01:23:46.840 --> 01:23:50.100
So maybe you want to eat in the house of this.

01:23:50.620 --> 01:23:51.820
No, but they eat camel.

01:23:53.080 --> 01:23:55.840
We told them that the camel is halal.

01:23:56.020 --> 01:23:56.760
We don't eat it.

01:23:57.460 --> 01:23:59.340
Basav halal, they eat basav halal.

01:24:00.620 --> 01:24:01.660
We don't eat.

01:24:01.660 --> 01:24:09.660
So what means that no matter what, a Jew is not going to eat in the house of a Muslim.

01:24:09.660 --> 01:24:12.660
You cannot eat in the house of a Muslim. Why?

01:24:12.660 --> 01:24:15.660
Basar v'halav, they cook basar v'halav.

01:24:15.660 --> 01:24:23.660
You see? So the way the laws that were made, you could tell that only a Jew could have made those laws.

01:24:23.660 --> 01:24:26.660
So halav means it's just shechitan.

01:24:26.660 --> 01:24:29.440
Shehitah, not that it is again.

01:24:30.380 --> 01:24:32.020
Milah, there is milah.

01:24:34.200 --> 01:24:35.740
No, more than this.

01:24:36.160 --> 01:24:37.200
But there is no periah.

01:24:38.960 --> 01:24:39.920
So many other words.

01:24:40.080 --> 01:24:41.600
El masal que no el pescaraychou.

01:24:44.900 --> 01:24:45.820
No periah.

01:24:45.820 --> 01:24:49.820
What is periah?

01:24:50.000 --> 01:24:53.600
Periah is, you cut the, and then you have to,

01:24:53.600 --> 01:24:56.060
fold it over.

01:24:56.660 --> 01:24:57.660
Yes, that's very hard.

01:24:57.660 --> 01:24:59.460
They have no very hard.

01:24:59.460 --> 01:25:02.660
It means we know that is not a Jewish.

01:25:02.660 --> 01:25:05.360
So you're saying a Jew originated that?

01:25:05.360 --> 01:25:08.660
Yes, and this was a Chacham that wrote about that.

01:25:08.660 --> 01:25:10.660
Yes, the Chacham.

01:25:10.660 --> 01:25:13.460
We did it especially not to allow them,

01:25:13.460 --> 01:25:19.460
on the one hand they say, oh, we have Milah, the Jews.

01:25:19.460 --> 01:25:23.960
How the Jews learned not to make Milah?

01:25:23.960 --> 01:25:24.960
They practiced on it.

01:25:24.960 --> 01:25:25.960
They practiced on the era.

01:25:25.960 --> 01:25:28.020
was 13 years old, it's much easier to do

01:25:28.020 --> 01:25:30.200
than an eight-day boy.

01:25:31.240 --> 01:25:31.800
That's the way

01:25:31.800 --> 01:25:34.100
the Jews practiced Milah.

01:25:34.500 --> 01:25:35.820
Ask anybody older,

01:25:36.340 --> 01:25:37.960
yes, your father will remember

01:25:37.960 --> 01:25:38.180
this.

01:25:38.180 --> 01:25:41.840
They take people that are learning,

01:25:42.360 --> 01:25:43.440
they go to an Arab,

01:25:43.880 --> 01:25:46.060
I think I heard that. That's the way we used to

01:25:46.060 --> 01:25:47.600
do it in the old country.

01:25:47.940 --> 01:25:50.160
I mean, me, I was born in

01:25:50.160 --> 01:25:52.080
Azaria, but that's the way they tell me they used to

01:25:52.080 --> 01:25:53.880
go, and they used to make Milah,

01:25:54.020 --> 01:25:55.240
and that's the practice of Jews.

01:25:55.240 --> 01:26:00.920
that's what I think

01:26:00.920 --> 01:26:04.660
we have fantastic jokes about them

01:26:04.660 --> 01:26:06.580
and they

01:26:06.580 --> 01:26:08.440
you know

01:26:08.440 --> 01:26:10.080
but again

01:26:10.080 --> 01:26:13.240
the point is

01:26:13.240 --> 01:26:15.040
that we introduce ourselves

01:26:15.040 --> 01:26:16.340
as the people of the book

01:26:16.340 --> 01:26:18.700
and because

01:26:18.700 --> 01:26:21.220
we are the people of the book

01:26:21.220 --> 01:26:22.360
we believe in the book

01:26:22.360 --> 01:26:23.280
which is the Torah

01:26:23.280 --> 01:26:27.280
and we believe we are part of the book.

01:26:27.280 --> 01:26:29.280
Part and parcel of the book.

01:26:29.280 --> 01:26:31.280
Am Yisrael is the...

01:26:31.280 --> 01:26:33.280
Look, the Zohar says,

01:26:33.280 --> 01:26:35.280
something very beautiful,

01:26:35.280 --> 01:26:37.280
people did not realize.

01:26:37.280 --> 01:26:39.280
They say that...

01:26:39.280 --> 01:26:43.280
There were 600,000 Jews

01:26:43.280 --> 01:26:45.280
in Sinai.

01:26:45.280 --> 01:26:47.280
And the Zohar says

01:26:47.280 --> 01:26:49.280
that there are 600,000 letters

01:26:49.280 --> 01:26:51.280
in the 7th Koran.

01:26:51.280 --> 01:27:00.280
The truth is that there are no 600,000 letters in the separate round.

01:27:00.280 --> 01:27:05.280
There are only about 220,000 or 230,000 letters.

01:27:05.280 --> 01:27:11.280
I believe that is all I wanted to say, that this is the separate round.

01:27:11.280 --> 01:27:16.280
The 600,000 Jews is a separate round.

01:27:16.280 --> 01:27:17.940
is the acceptor of the Bible.

01:27:19.180 --> 01:27:22.880
So we are the people of the book.

01:27:23.680 --> 01:27:24.640
I look it up.

01:27:26.580 --> 01:27:28.200
Oh, I said to my students,

01:27:28.420 --> 01:27:30.400
I have Arab students in there.

01:27:31.080 --> 01:27:34.160
So I like to speak Arabic.

01:27:34.540 --> 01:27:35.640
And I say them all the time.

01:27:36.100 --> 01:27:39.900
And the most interesting thing is

01:27:39.900 --> 01:27:41.520
