And again, what happened?

01:27:44.680 --> 01:27:49.600
some one of my Arab students, his uncle passed away and he wanted to know the

01:27:49.600 --> 01:27:55.840
laws of Abelutot, of the Muslim world. And I said, my grandfather, laugh at that.

01:27:57.680 --> 01:28:03.460
But they, we are the people of the book and we are the model. We are the model.

01:28:03.880 --> 01:28:08.220
You know, we are the Amkados in a sense. We all are imperfections. We are not

01:28:08.220 --> 01:28:15.600
perfect and so on, but we still we are amkaros, with all our imperfections, yes, we could

01:28:15.600 --> 01:28:25.700
